# headwear/helm/greathelm: the Great helm (P2c ladder slice, LADDER-HEAD; form3, band3): the heartland's closed helm from
# T4. A steel barrel lit as a sphere (the lit left plane in step 3, the turn in 2, the shadowed right in 1; one glint at the
# crown's top-left) with one lit ridge down the front, closed to a 1 px eye slit on the eye row (N: it glows at T6) split by
# the ridge, breaths punched low on the shadow side (N), a brow band (P: etched at T4, filigree at T5) with a gem socket
# on the ridge (G: a metal-2 boss at T4, the brow gem at T5), and a rim over the slit and round the chin (R: brass at T4,
# gilt at T5). It covers the face and the ears to the chin; '-' masks the hair above the band, and hair longer than the
# helm still shows below it. The crest and plume are headwear/helm/greathelm_crest (crestN / plumes). Shared by both
# bodies (D10). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role helm form3
role helm band3
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
tags overlay
legend X glow 3

